      "summary": "QA verdicts and their projections — kg-qa audits, block and translation QA, qa-witness documents for the docs site, the viewer-navbar audit, result roll-ups and test runs; every `$schema` family is named in `nodeSchemas`, which is the list — a count here would be a second one, and it was already wrong by one before `viewer-nav-qa/v1` was added. Generated; never hand-edited."
